# TICKET-0058 (BRIEF-0058-b). Append-only record of every graph
# implementation ever retired from frontend/src/graph/registry.js's
# GRAPH_IMPLS: one line per retired key, `<key>|<fnPrefix>|<locus>`. A key
# enters this file in the same commit that removes it from registry.js,
# and is never removed or edited afterward — tooling/verify/checks/
# graph_primitive.py's rule 5b reads it to prove the retired
# implementation's code is permanently gone from its locus, not just
# unregistered.
